five kinds of thing, one bit per component, highest id first
    player  00011111  {position velocity health sprite player}
    drone   00001111  {position velocity health sprite}
    turret  00101101  {position health sprite turret}
    rock    00001001  {position sprite}
    ghost   01001011  {position velocity sprite frozen}
query move: all {position velocity}, none {frozen}
